  << /ActualText (UI \057 GRAPHIC DESIGNER \174 Tejas Groups \174 Apr 2020 \023 Nov 2025\n\042 Designed intuitive user interfaces and digital assets\054 transitioning traditional graphic workflows into cohesive\054 modern online user experiences\056\n\042 Collaborated directly with stakeholders and internal teams to translate client requirements into functional design wireframes and high\055fidelity\n   mockups\056\n\042 Established and managed structured Figma design files\054 asset libraries\054 and production\055ready outputs\054 drastically reducing handoff friction for \n  development teams\056\n\042 Upskilled in modern front\055end technologies \050React\054 Tailwind CSS\051 to build and prototype responsive\054 real\055world web components directly from design layouts\056\n  \nAUTOCAD DESIGNER \174 Modine Thermal Systems \174 Aug 2019 \023 Mar 2020\n\042 Developed precise 2D and 3D technical drawings for thermal system components\054 ensuring strict manufacturing accuracy through detailed CAD modeling\056\n\042 Streamlined workflows by developing standardized component libraries and technical documentation for complex assemblies\056\n\nAUTOCAD DESIGNER \174 Wheels India Pvt Ltd \174 Jul 2018 \023 Jul 2019\nCreated detailed 2D technical drawings and layouts for commercial vehicle wheels in AutoCAD\054 maintaining dimensional tolerances and supporting manufacturing accuracy)
