  << /ActualText (Meristems E\055Commerce \174 Figma\054 Next\056js\054 Firebase\n\042 Designed a comprehensive end\055to\055end user shopping flow in Figma\054 focusing on intuitive product discovery and checkout UI layouts\056\n\042 Built out the interactive front\055end components utilizing Next\056js to ensure design choices matched the live web performance goals\056\n\nReal Estate Platform \174 Figma\054 React\056js\054 Tailwind CSS\054 JavaScript\n\042 Created a clean\054 mobile\055first user interface tailored for property browsing\054 emphasizing visual hierarchy and easy filtering structures\056\n\042 Independently translated the entire design system into live\054 responsive code using React and Tailwind CSS\056\n\n3D Car Showcase Website \174 Figma\054 React\056js\054 Tailwind CSS\054 Three\056js\n\042 Explored cutting\055edge interactive design trends by blending immersive 3D elements with standard user interface design patterns\056\n\042 Prototyped the interface layout in Figma before engineering the front\055end components for fluid user interactions\056)
